{"id":"00010","root":"uni00010_1","name":{"ja":"イングリッド","en":"Ingrid"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"イングリッド","en":"Ingrid"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Nomad"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":10,"profile":{"ja":"エドウィン・ブラックの側近。エドウィン・ブラックの勢力に属する魔界の貴族階級の子弟出身。常に彼に従い護衛として、優秀な秘書として仕えている。魔界騎士の異名を持つ美女。得物は長剣。斬り裂いた敵を黒い炎で焼き尽くす魔剣術の使い手。エドウィン・ブラックには主と臣下の関係以上の思いを抱いているが、それは胸の奥に秘め、常に献身的。ただしエドウィン・ブラック以外には冷徹な風で接し、朧とは対立している。魔族と呼ばれる魔界では多数を占める種族で、人間と姿は似ているが身体能力は超人的で人間とは比較にならない戦闘能力を有す。","en":"Ingrid is a close aide to Edwin Black. Born into a noble family of the Demon Realm that serves Edwin Black's faction, she constantly follows his orders, acting as both his guard and an excellent secretary. Known as the \"Demon-Realm Knight,\" she is a striking beauty who wields a longsword. She is a master of demonic swordsmanship, incinerating foes she slashes with black flames. While she harbors feelings for Edwin Black that go beyond a master-servant relationship, she keeps them hidden and remains devoted. Toward anyone other than Edwin Black, she is cold and ruthless, and she is at odds with Oboro. The demon race, which dominates the Demon Realm, resembles humans in appearance but possesses superhuman physical abilities and combat prowess far beyond those of humans."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"榊木春乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00010_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1188,2376],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[250,500],"def":[136,272],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","33"]},{"id":"uni00010_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1776,3552],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[425,850],"def":[197,394],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","33","34"]},{"id":"uni00010_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2364,4728],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[600,1200],"def":[258,516],"spd":[65,65],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","33","34","35"]}],"sk